; PhysicalSkyMaterial, Godot's Preetham atmospheric scattering sky, with the sun low enough that
; the Rayleigh term reddens the horizon. The scene brings its own DirectionalLight3D (the
; shader's LIGHT0: without it a physical sky has no sun and renders black) and its own
; WorldEnvironment, so no editor preview applies.
